<h1>About This Guide</h1>

<p>This is a strictly nonpartisan voter guide for the Ashtabula County, Ohio November 3, 2026 general election. It contains no endorsements, no voting recommendations, and no partisan framing.</p>

<h2>How It Was Built</h2>
<p>The ballot race and issue lists were checked against the official Ashtabula County Board of Elections candidate list and issues sheet (both Rev. 9-15-26) on October 11, 2026. Election dates and voting hours were cross-checked against the Ohio Secretary of State’s 2026 voting schedule. Candidate biographies, positions, and voting records are research summaries; source lists are provided per candidate, and claim-by-claim citations and verification remain in progress.</p>

<h2>Verification</h2>
<ul>
  <li>All 10 candidate races verified against the official BOE candidate list</li>
  <li>41 numbered ballot items (Issues 3–43, with Issues 1–2 absent from this guide); 36 are property-tax levies</li>
  <li>One correction made: removed a candidate not on the Ashtabula County ballot</li>
  <li>Each candidate has a research-source list; individual candidate claims still need claim-by-claim citations</li>
  <li>Research dates and verification status shown on every page</li>
</ul>

